  "notes": "A godan (う) verb. The noun form {割|わ}り{振|ふ}り (allocation, assignment) is also commonly used.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive. The thing being assigned is marked with を, and the recipient with に.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {仕事|しごと}を{割|わ}り{振|ふ}る: to assign work\n- {役割|やくわり}を{割|わ}り{振|ふ}る: to assign roles\n- {予算|よさん}を{割|わ}り{振|ふ}る: to allocate a budget\n- {番号|ばんごう}を{割|わ}り{振|ふ}る: to assign numbers\n- {担当|たんとう}を{割|わ}り{振|ふ}る: to assign responsibilities\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {配分|はいぶん}する: to distribute, to apportion — more formal; used for resources, profits, and funds\n- {振|ふ}り{分|わ}ける: to divide up, to distribute — similar meaning but less common\n- {割|わ}り{当|あ}てる: to assign, to allot — very similar; slightly more formal",
